 //   shape carries a dark outline -- a mean of 12.7% of the field is near-black line.
 //   The forge laid flat areas of colour edge to edge with no line at all, which is
 //   the look of vector clip-art and not of a pen. `ink` at the head of a device gives
 //   every course an outline it has not asked otherwise for.
